# This repo tracks only a few things out of the whole Cube Chaos install:
#   - .claude/         the Claude Code skills used to build mods
#   - GameData/DJ/     the DJ mod we've built (our own content, including its
#                      own README.md and Preview/ sprite-preview images)
#   - GameData/General/ the General mod (same deal)
#   - GameData/Unholy/  the Unholy species mod (same deal)
#   - GameData/Broker/  the Broker class mod (same deal)
#   - GameData/Voidling/ the Voidling species mod (same deal)
#   - GameData/DJ_Voidling/ the DJ+Voidling crossover synergy mod (same deal)
#   - GameData/Great_Wall/ the battlefields (Terrain perk) mod (same deal)
#   - GameData/Home_Turf_Advantage/ the standalone Neutral-perk mod (same deal)
#   - README.md        repo-level docs
#   - WORKFLOW_OVERVIEW.md  repo-level docs (diagram of the modding workflow)
# Everything else (game binaries, base-game GameData folders, and any other
# mod folders that come and go as you subscribe/unsubscribe on the Workshop)
# is deliberately left untracked.

# Ignore everything at the repo root by default...
/*
# ...then explicitly un-ignore what we want tracked.
!/.gitignore
!/CLAUDE.md
!/README.md
!/WORKFLOW_OVERVIEW.md
!/.claude/
!/GameData/

# Inside GameData, ignore everything except our own mod folders.
/GameData/*
!/GameData/DJ/
!/GameData/General/
!/GameData/Unholy/
!/GameData/Broker/
!/GameData/Voidling/
!/GameData/DJ_Voidling/
!/GameData/Great_Wall/
!/GameData/Home_Turf_Advantage/

# Personal/machine-local Claude Code settings - contains local permission rules
# with absolute paths tied to whoever's machine set them up (usernames, drive
# letters, etc). Never commit this; each contributor keeps their own.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Personal working-style preferences (preview-gate strictness, sprite art
# effort, naming/color check-ins, README timing, proactive write-back,
# test-launch behavior) - set up by the cube-chaos-repo-setup skill. Every
# contributor keeps their own; nobody's personal taste gets forced on anyone
# else working from this same shared repo.
.claude/preferences.local.md

# OS/editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# Python bytecode cache from running .claude/ scripts (e.g. render_preview_cards.py)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
